{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 1014,
	"Name": "(Out of Date) New Map - Jungle Temple",
	"Author": "UlithiumDragon",
	"AuthorLabel": "Ulithium_Dragon",
	"Description": "[b]NOTE: This mod is out of date. If anyone wants to update this mod, edit it, scrap it for parts, w.e. you have my full permission.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />Hey guys! I've been working hard at trying to make some new maps, and I've got something functional enough to release now - \u00A0a jungle temple map:\n<br />\n<br />[center][img]https://i.imgur.com/IRqphKL.jpg[/img]\uFEFF[/center]\n<br />[b]==========================\n<br />[/b]\n<br />At the moment, the exterior is completed, and a basic interior with a few rooms has been started. I plan on doing more of course, that's just what's done at the moment.\n<br />\n<br />You can find the entrance at the back of the Secret Forest, behind the ruins and statue (north of the small pond).\n<br />[b]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]NOTE: This mod *may* be incompatible with other mods that edit the Secret Forest. I've only tested it with Tego's Stardew Expansion, which *is* compatible. I don't know of any other mods that edit the Secret Forest, so if you find an incompatible mod, let me know and I'll see about maybe getting a patch made![/size]\n<br />\n<br />_______________________________________________________________________________________________\n<br />[/b]\n<br />[b][size=5][u]REQUIREMENTS[/u]:\n<br />[/size][/b]\n<br />-\u00A0[url=http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/smapi-advanced-location-loader.114124]Advanced Location Loader[/url] (and [url=http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/smapi-stardew-modding-api.108375]all of[/url] it's [url=http://community.playstarbound.com/resources/entoarox-framework.4228]requirements[/url]).\n<br />[i]*Made for [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/SMAPI/releases/tag/1.8]v1.8 of SMAPI[/url] and v1.2 of [url=http://community.playstarbound.com/resources/smapi-advanced-location-loader.3619/]ALL[/url]. I will try to keep it up to date with any updates to either of those things, just know that if I don't then it might not work anymore!\n<br />[/i]\n<br />[b][u]This mod WILL NOT WORK with the nightly build (the v1.2 beta update). Once it is fully released I will update this mod to it, but until then this mod will only work with v1.11 of Stardew Valley.[/u][/b]\n<br />\n<br />_______________________________________________________________________________________________\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=4]Alternate Download Location:[/size]\n<br />[/b]\n<br />[url=http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/new-map-jungle-temple.131412]http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/new-map-jungle-temple.131412[/url]\n<br />\n<br />_______________________________________________________________________________________________\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=4]Changelog:[/size][/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]v1.0:[/b]\n<br />- Added three new rooms - a junction room, and two side rooms (left and right).\n<br />- Overhauled the temple interior room quite a lot. Also some minor tweaks and fixes to the temple exterior.\n<br />- Added requirements for entering each new room activate the tablet with the glowing red runes on it to learn more!\n<br />[i]*GINORMOUS thankyouthankyouthankyou's to both Entoarox and Androxilogin for helping me figure out how to set this up correctly!!![/i]\n<br />\n<br />[b]v0.5 Beta:[/b]\n<br />- Fixed the foliage not showing up (bushes, rocks, etc.). HUGE thanks to Entoarox for helping me fix this!\n<br />\n<br />[b]v0.4 Beta:[/b]\n<br />- Fixed a boo-boo in the code that caused all my new locations and edits to not show up (god I hate javascript).\n<br />[b]\n<br />v0.3 Beta:[/b]\n<br />- Fixed the bug that was causing the player to enter the Secret Woods map at the center (still no clue what was causing this).\n<br />[b]\n<br />v0.2 Beta:[/b]\n<br />- Accidentally put in \"Sewer.xnb\" instead of \"SewerTiles.xnb\" (my bad). I put the right one in this time.\n<br />[b]\n<br />v0.1 Beta:[/b]\n<br />- Initial Release.",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1014",
